  "description": "Image Composer Pixaroma Workflow is a multi-image composition workflow designed to combine or condition on multiple images in one controlled edit using the models configured in the graph. Its 2-node graph exposes 0 prompt/text field(s), 1 media input target(s), and 1 save/preview stage(s), while preserving the original editor-format graph for reference. The ComfyUI editor graph was converted to API format and is ready for live validation against the connected node and model registry.",
